                                "sense_id": "1f511a6e-1e62-3bdb-9c8f-2d43d43a0c07",
                                "text": "She has a bubbly personality."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f03ffd7e-fc05-47dc-a7d0-abd4f3b509dc",
                                "sense_id": "1f511a6e-1e62-3bdb-9c8f-2d43d43a0c07",
                                "text": "“Our priority is to make relationships with people,” says Mariana Gomes, a bubbly social worker who methodically jots down whom she meets and what they need in a giant binder."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "093dbe65-538a-405f-9f95-9d6892332ce1",
                                "sense_id": "1f511a6e-1e62-3bdb-9c8f-2d43d43a0c07",
                                "text": "Outgoing and bubbly, she quickly made friends in her new town."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bea17108-22d6-3adf-800b-7f47dba2f034",
